/// `[3:hidden·user·12]`, `[2-6:ckpt·38k→40tok·covers:3,5]`, the #2394
/// forms `[expand 3-140]` / `old session list [expand 142-143]`, each
/// optionally behind the record tag the epoch adds on the wire
